  "content": "[Intro]\n[G]  [Bm]\n[E]\n[Am]  [C]\n[Eb]\n[Bb]\n[Dm]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[G]There's [Bm]nothing left to hide;\n[E]\n[Am]You can [C]see it in my eyes.\n[Eb]Oh I've tried,\n[Bb]to\n[Dm]be who I thought you wan-\n[G]ted.\n[G]And [Bm]if it's all a lie,\n[E]\n[Am]The [C]truth's not far behind.\n[Eb]We could try\n[Bb]to\n[Dm]live right follow the mo-\n[G]ment.\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bm][G]Ramona!\n[E]\n[C][Am]Ramona...\n[Eb]Oh, oh.\n[Bb]Ramo-\n[Dm]na.\n[G]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[G]If [Bm]only I had known,\n[E]\n[Am]It's less [C]than what I felt,\n[Eb]Why should I\n[Bb]have no-\n[Dm]thing to fear\n[G]for?\n\n[Interlude]\n[Bm][G]Ramona...\n[E]\n[C][Am]Ramona...\n[Eb]Oh, oh.\n[Bb]Ramo-\n[Dm]\n[G]\nna.\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bm][G]Ramona!\n[E]Oh oh,\n[C][Am]Ramo-\n[Eb]na! Oh\n[Bb]my, Ramo-\n[Dm]na!\n[G]\n[Bm][G]Ramo-\n[E]na!\n[C][Am]Ramo-\n[Eb]na! Oh,\n[Bb]Ramo-\n[Dm]\n[G]na!",
